B.a6r=new A.S("Wat is het meest g\xeanante dat je op school of op je werk is overkomen?","What is the most embarrassing thing that happened to you at school or work?")
B.a5o=new A.S("Wat is je verborgen talent?","What is your hidden talent?")
B.a60=new A.S("Wat is het beste cadeau dat je ooit hebt gekregen?","What is the best present you have ever received?")
B.a4Y=new A.S("Waar word je altijd vrolijk van?","What always cheers you up?")
B.a6b=new A.S("Wat is je mooiste herinnering met iemand hier aan tafel?","What is your favourite memory with someone here?")
B.a4b=new A.S("Welke uitvinding zou je willen bedenken?","What invention would you like to come up with?")
B.a6l=new A.S("Hoe lang ben je ooit in bed blijven liggen?","What is the longest you have ever stayed in bed?")
B.a52=new A.S("Wat was je eerste huisdier, of welk huisdier zou je willen?","What was your first pet, or which pet would you like?")
B.a6M=new A.S("Wat is het lekkerste dat iemand hier kan koken?","What is the tastiest thing someone here can cook?")
B.a5Y=new A.S("Welk gerecht kun je \xe9cht niet uitstaan?","Which dish can you really not stand?")
B.a66=new A.S("Welke film heb je het vaakst gezien?","Which film have you seen the most times?")
B.a4q=new A.S("Wat wilde je vroeger later worden?","What did you want to be when you grew up?")
B.a6F=new A.S("Wanneer heb je voor het laatst gehuild, en waarom?","When did you last cry, and why?")
B.a7c=new A.S("Wat is de raarste droom die je je herinnert?","What is the strangest dream you remember?")
